<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-019" chapter-id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao" source-id="s-nanshi-019-xiezao-ws1531762">
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">兄<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAA">才卿</persName>早卒，子<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001:m0007" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAAA">藻</persName>幼孤，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001:m0011" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAB">幾卿</persName>撫養甚至。及<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001:m0019" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAAA">藻</persName>成立，歷清官，皆<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiezao:p001:m0028" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAB">幾卿</persName>獎訓之力也。</p>
</text>
